meta {
  name: Admin - Update Designation
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

patch {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/admin/designations/{{designationId}}
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "name": "Updated Designation Name",
    "isActive": true
  }
}

docs {
  # Admin - Update Designation

  Renames a designation and/or activates/deactivates it.
  Requires: SuperUser / Admin / Management / HR DeptHOD

  **Renaming also updates every user who has the old name** (same transaction),
  so no one is left with the old spelling.
  Deactivating only hides it from the dropdown — users keep their value.

  ## Body
  | Field    | Required | Description                 |
  |----------|----------|-----------------------------|
  | name     | No       | New unique designation name |
  | isActive | No       | true or false               |

  ## Errors
  | Status | Reason                            |
  |--------|-----------------------------------|
  | 400    | Name is empty                     |
  | 404    | Designation not found             |
  | 409    | Designation name already exists   |
  | 403    | Insufficient role                 |
}
